Z||000039||My7Fieros||12-13-2001||01:59 PM||||Hey Nashco, do they still have Del Taco in Calhoun County? When I lived there (1985-1990), every Tues night they had 25 cent tacos...YUM YUM. Man I could put a hurtin' on 'em!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><BR>Somebody on here actually mention Hardees. I think I'd rather eat pea gravel and hot tar than Hardees. Hardees finally closed doors in Memphis.<BR>I eat fast food EVERY day...heres what I eat the most...<BR>Sonic- burger w/ chili/cheese only, fries, route 44 cherry coke or vanilla Dr. Pepper (YUMMMMMMM!!)<BR>Wendys- double or triple burger combo (that usually lasts me an entire day lol)<BR>Subway- bread and lettuce sandwhich...oh wait, thats all they serve! lol...nah, usually a meatball sandwhich. <BR>Damn near every Thursday I got to Ed Parks Fiero Factory and I eat at KFC buffet in Huntsville on hwy 53 just down the road...and I usually regret it lol.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>------------------<BR>       <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/My7logo_1.gif"> ||||reg||1
